Pokemon Sun and Moon is now out and has  a lot of new features in it so many in  fact that it can be a little hard to  keep track of so here are some tips and  tricks for you to get the most out of  your Pokemon experience the QR scanner  is a feature that lets you well scan QR  codes each scan gives you information  about Pokemon which is cool for those of  you with fondness for scanners but it  also serves a larger purpose every skin  gets through ten points and once you  reach 100 points you unlock island scan  which lets you search an island for a  rare Pokemon any QR code will work but  if you need one your pokedex has codes  for Pokemon you have caught so invite  your friends over and have a scanning  party once you activate island scan you  are given a location and a limited time  to catch it make sure to activate island  scan on an island you have fully  explored otherwise you might not be able  to make it in time to the Pokemon trials  are the replacements for gyms in Sun and  Moon and I got to post trial tips for  you while a trial is happening you can't  catch any Pokemon in that area so it's  always a good idea to revisit these  areas after the trial is over so you  don't miss any Pokemon to catch the  second tip after beating a trial head to  the PokeMart as you unlock new items to  purchase  Pokemon refresh is the Sun and moons  version of pokémon-amie  from X&amp;Y where you can pet and feed your  Pokemon to raise their affection which  gives wonderful benefits such as XP  boosts higher accuracy and dodge and  even higher crit rates you can also  enter refresh rate after a battle where  you must clean and care for your Pokemon  and can help remove status ailments like  poison you probably don't want to use  Pokemon refresh after every battle as  that would get a little tedious but it  is worth hopping in there every once in  a while to keep your Pokemon healthy and  happy  the HMS from previous Pokemon games have  been completely removed and replaced  with writable pokemon that served the  same functions like Toros for rock smash  and Lapras for swim but the one you want  to keep bringing up whenever you can is  stout land a massive dog like Pokemon  who will sniff out items for you  stat 'land is also a much faster means  of travel basically replacing the roller  blades from X&amp;Y  a fantastic upgrade if you ask me the  Pokemon daycare has also been replaced  with a new building the nursery it's  pretty much the same thing with one key  difference your Pokemon no longer level  up making the nursery purely for making  eggs which also makes it a lot cheaper  and honestly I'm okay with this leveling  up in the daycare was always an  expensive slow process and if your  Pokemon learn to move while in the  daycare it would automatically override  another move which was just a huge pain  so you never really wanted to level up  while in the daycare anyway and it  really just got in the way of our real  goal making babies the Z moves is one of  Sun and moons big new features powerful  beefed up attacks that deal massive  damage and play out like a Final Fantasy  summon  in order for your Pokemon to do easy  move you have to equip them with Z  crystals there's a crystal for each type  of move don't forget to actually equip  your Z crystals on your pokemons  otherwise they can't do the move and  also don't be afraid to try out  different Z crystal types on Pokemon as  long as your Pokemon has a move of that  type they can use that crystal this is a  staple of Pokemon games but it's worth  reminding you to take the time to talk  with every NPC you encounter apart from  getting some pretty funny dialogue you  can also get free items and characters  who will tell you important information  like a pokemons friendship level there's  also NPCs who will want to trade with  you and others who will simply want to  see a pokemons information on a pokedex  meaning you have to catch it and then  when you bring it back to them you get a  nice cash reward the Pokemon peligro is  a collection of small islands you can  visit after getting the ability to fly  here all your PC box Pokemon will hang  out and you can see how they're doing  the starting island has a beanstalk that  will grow beans for you daily in  addition to using these beans to feed  your Pokemon and Pokemon refresh you can  also use these beans to invest in the  creation of other islands that will do  things like grow berries for you or have  your Pokemon explore caves for items  it's worth taking the time each day to  collect all your goodies from the telugu  pokemon festival is the new hub location  for battles and trades with other real  players an avatar of a player can visit  your plaza through the use of the 3ds  local wireless communication or the good  old fashioned internet and you can view  their stats and recent events in the  game you can also send them to try out  one of your festivals games and stalls  which you can swap out over time you can  also play and buy from these stalls  yourselves which get you things like  items and stat boosts for your Pokemon  make sure you hop into the festival  Plaza to interact with people and get  some goodies and there are some good  beginner tips you should remember when  exploring the region of Aloha  for those of you who have just picked up  the game and are playing let me know in  the comments which started Pokemon you  picked and what your favorite part of  the game is so far  I picked RAL it just look at that guy  what a cutie for more coverage of  Pokemon Sun and Moon stay tuned to game  spot
 

